'''Benjamin Kirby Tennyson''', also known as '''Omniverse Ben''',{{Refn|[[:File:Tinction (2752).png]]|group = credits}} is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]]. He is a representation of 16-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]] from '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Ben 10: Omniverse]]'''.

==Appearance==
Ben is a teenage version of his Reboot counterpart with brown hair. He wears a white hooded jacket with two green stripes on both arms and a green number 10 on the right side. He wears brown cargo pants with pockets at the knees and green and white shoes. He wears the Omnitrix on his left wrist.

<gallery hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent" captionalign="center" spacing="small">
Hood Ben AXT.png|Ben with his hood up
</gallery>

==Personality==
Compared to the other teenage alternate Bens, '''Omniverse''' Ben is notably more cocky. Despite his attitude, however, he is self-sacrificing, wiling to use himself as a shield to protect others, and is a heroic person like most any other Ben Tennyson. His attempts to be friendly to his younger counterparts often rub them the wrong way, despite his good intentions.

==History==
=== Ben 10 ===
'''Omniverse''' Ben first appears in ''[[Alien X-Tinction]]'', where he is brought to [[Reboot Timeline|Dimension 27998.3]] by [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]] and [[Maximilian Tennyson|Maximilian]] to help fight [[Alien X (Reboot)|Alien X]]. When [[Ben Tennyson (Original Series Homage Dimension)|Original Series Ben]] as [[Heatblast (Reboot)|Heatblast]] is having trouble blowing up raining boulders, '''Omniverse''' Ben turns into [[Bloxx (Reboot)|Bloxx]] to protect him, Ben, [[Gwen Tennyson (Reboot)|Gwen]], [[Max Tennyson (Reboot)|Max]], Maximilian, [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]] as [[Ampfibian (Reboot)|Ampfibian]], and [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10 Dimension)|Gwen 10]] as [[Ripjaws (Reboot)|Ripjaws]].

Ben eventually convinces everyone to fight Alien X at the time. As Bloxx, '''Omniverse''' Ben is able to synchronize his powers with his counterparts and remove the alternate Omnitrix from Alien X's left shoulder. After Alien X is defeated, '''Omniverse''' Ben states that he was not expecting their enemy to be [[Ben_X|an evil adult Ben]]. As Maximilian takes Ben X elsewhere, Ben thanks the others, stating that he could not have beaten Alien X without them. '''Omniverse''' Ben cockily agrees, stating that he could not have done it without him. He is last seen being shoved into the portal by Gwen 10 before returning to his home dimension.

==Powers and Abilities==
===Equipment===
[[File:Tinction (2288).png|thumb|Omnitrix]]
Ben possesses the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]]. Through it, he can transform into various aliens and utilize their respective powers.
====Aliens Used====
*[[Bloxx (Reboot)|Bloxx]]

==Weaknesses==
Whenever the Omnitrix times out, Ben is left powerless until he switches to a new alien form.

