==Trivia==
*This Ben's design is a stylized version of 16-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s occasional appearance in '''Omniverse'''.
*'''Omniverse''' Ben's inclusion in the [[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|reboot]] was first hinted by [[Duncan Rouleau]] when giving vague hints on what to expect for Season 5.{{Refn|[[:File:Duncan's crossover ideas.png]]|group = DR}}
*'''Omniverse''' Ben is shown wearing his hood over his head, something Ben Prime never did on-screen. This trait is instead something [[Nega Ben]] exclusively performed.[[File:OV Omnitrix Core AXT.png|right]]
*The square faceplate on '''Omniverse''' Ben's Omnitrix is part of the Omnitrix's core and pops up when activated instead of the faceplate sliding upwards to reveal its core like it does in '''Omniverse''', however this is an animation error.
*The reason why '''Omniverse''' Ben used only Bloxx during ''Alien X-Tinction'' was due to time constraints and design costs.{{Refn|[[:File:Alternate Bens Limited Aliens Explanation.png]]|group = DR}} 
*Duncan Rouleau originally stated that the four alternate Bens featured in ''Alien X-Tinction'' are the same as [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]] from the previous four series.{{Refn|group=DR|[[:File:All Alternate Bens are Classic Ben.png]]}} However, he later rescinded that statement, stating that they are from alternate timelines.{{Refn|[[:File:AXT Bens are not Prime.png]]|group = DR}}
**[[Cartoon Network]] already indicated this, when it said in the description of a video that [[Ben Tennyson (Alien Force Homage Dimension)|'''Alien Force''' Ben]] and [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]] are from different dimensions.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/6aZT9D1S5Oc|group = CN}}

